    '黑曜石集团：全球私人军事公司，表面上是安全承包商，实际上控制着武器交易、情报市场和政府暗杀。新黎明组织：极端科技组织，相信人类必须经历一次全球危机才能进化，拥有AI武器、生物技术和无人军队。深海协议：未知组织，他们似乎提前知道王牌突击队的所有行动。': 'The Obsidian Group: a global private military company. Publicly a security contractor — in truth, it controls the arms trade, the intelligence market, and state assassinations. New Dawn: an extremist tech organization that believes humanity must endure a global crisis to evolve, wielding AI weapons, biotechnology, and unmanned armies. The Abyss Protocol: an unknown entity that seems to know every Ace-Ops operation in advance.',
    '代号"幽灵"。王牌突击队第一任行动队长。冷静、极度理性，不相信英雄主义。他曾带领一支精锐部队执行任务，任务成功，但因为政治原因，所有队员被官方否认存在。从那以后，他加入王牌突击队。他说："英雄需要观众，而我们不能留下观众。"': 'Callsign "Ghost." Ace-Ops\' first operational commander. Calm, ruthlessly rational, and a believer in nothing — least of all heroism. He once led an elite unit that succeeded, only for every member to be officially denied existence for political reasons. That is when he joined Ace-Ops. He says: "Heroes need an audience. And we cannot leave one behind."',
    '代号"猎鹰"。前顶级远程作战专家，沉默寡言。座右铭："距离不是保护，是责任。"装备模块化狙击系统和智能瞄准辅助。她的每一次扣动扳机，都意味着一个威胁在无人知晓中被消除。': 'Callsign "Falcon." A former top-tier long-range operations specialist. A woman of few words. Motto: "Distance is not protection. It is responsibility." Equipped with a modular sniper system and smart targeting assistance. Every trigger she pulls eliminates a threat that the world will never know existed.',
    '代号"堡垒"。团队的重装突破手，团队的盾牌。装备防弹外骨骼和重型武器系统。看似粗暴，实际是团队里最保护队友的人。在枪林弹雨中，他总是第一个冲进去，最后一个撤出来。': 'Callsign "Bastion." The team\'s heavy breacher — its shield. Equipped with ballistic exoskeleton and heavy weapon systems. Gruff on the outside, but the one who protects his teammates above all. Through the storm of bullets, he is always the first in and the last out.',
    '代号"零"。黑客/无人系统专家，团队最年轻的核心成员。能力：网络入侵、无人机控制、情报分析。曾是世界顶级网络安全研究员，因为发现某个秘密计划，被招募进入王牌突击队。': 'Callsign "Zero." Hacker and unmanned-systems specialist — the youngest core member of the team. Skills: network intrusion, drone control, intelligence analysis. Once a world-class cybersecurity researcher, recruited into Ace-Ops after uncovering a secret program.',
    '代号"暗影"。近战专家，行动无声。过去完全未知，甚至队伍数据库里只有："出生日期：未知。"没有人知道他来自哪里，也没有人敢问。当他在黑暗中现身时，任务通常已经完成了。': 'Callsign "Shadow." Close-combat expert who moves without a sound. His past is entirely unknown — even the unit database lists only: "Date of birth: unknown." No one knows where he comes from, and no one dares to ask. When he emerges from the dark, the mission is usually already done.',
    '王牌突击队的最高指挥。身份未知，甚至队员也不知道他的真实姓名。职责：分析全球危机、发布任务、判断行动是否合法。他从不露面，只通过加密频道下达指令。他的原则："如果世界知道我们存在，说明我们失败了。"': 'The supreme commander of Ace-Ops. Identity unknown — even the operatives do not know his real name. His duties: analyzing global crises, issuing missions, and judging whether an operation is justified. He never shows his face, issuing orders only through encrypted channels. His principle: "If the world knows we exist, we have already failed."',
    '即刻预购': 'Pre-order Now',
    '关闭': '닫기',
    '剧情': '스토리',
    '新内容': '새 소식',
    '角色': '캐릭터',
    '游戏玩法': '게임 플레이',
    '代号“暗影”。近战专家，行动无声。过去完全未知，甚至队伍数据库里只有：“出生日期：未知。”没有人知道他来自哪里，也没有人敢问。当他在黑暗中现身时，任务通常已经完成了。': 'Callsign "Shadow." Close-combat expert who moves without a sound. His past is entirely unknown — even the unit database lists only: "Date of birth: unknown." No one knows where he comes from, and no one dares to ask. When he emerges from the dark, the mission is usually already done.'
